# PrivyTool

Privacy-first online toolkit. **Image Tools** is the first live category. All image processing runs in the browser (Canvas) — never upload user files to a server.

**Also read when starting work:** `AGENTS.md`, `docs/CHECKLIST.md`, `docs/BUSINESS_PLAN.md`

## Stack

Next.js 16 (App Router), React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS 4, Zustand, Framer Motion. History in IndexedDB (`src/lib/history/idb.ts`). Export prefs in `localStorage` via `preferencesStore`.

## Where things live

| Area | Path |
|------|------|
| Pages | `src/app/tools/image/` |
| Panels / UI | `src/components/image/` |
| SEO template | `src/components/seo/ToolPageTemplate` |
| SEO copy | `src/content/tools/image.ts` |
| Engine | `src/lib/image/` (engine, compress, resize, formats) |
| State | `src/stores/imageStore.ts`, `historyStore.ts`, `preferencesStore.ts` |

## Live routes

`/`, `/tools/image`, `/tools/image/compress`, `/tools/image/resize`, `/tools/image/convert`, `/tools/image/history`

## Processing pipeline

1. `imageStore.setFile` → `loadImageFromFile` (ImageBitmap)
2. Panel calls `runCompress` / `runResize` (live preview: `{ silent: true }`)
3. Result blob + preview URL stored in `imageStore`
4. **Download** → `downloadBlob` + `historyStore.saveDownload(tool)`

## Conventions (must follow)

1. **Privacy:** Client-side only. No server uploads.
2. **Tool isolation:** `ImageToolWorkspace` clears `imageStore` on route change.
3. **Live preview:** Debounce; use separate async tokens for compress vs resize to avoid stale results.
4. **Export format:** `ExportFormatSelect` → `preferencesStore.exportFormatId`. Never silently convert JPG to WebP; flatten transparent letterbox to white for JPEG.
5. **History:** Save only on **Download** (not preview). Cap 30 entries in IDB.
6. **SEO pages:** `ToolPageTemplate` + `content/tools/` + `buildToolMetadata`.
7. **Design:** Tool pages = minimal hero + uploader. Fonts: Syne + Instrument Sans.
8. **Scope:** Minimal diffs. Match existing patterns. Update `docs/CHECKLIST.md` when shipping checklist items.

## Adding a new image tool

1. SEO content in `src/content/tools/image.ts`
2. Page at `src/app/tools/image/[tool]/page.tsx` with `ToolPageTemplate` + panel
3. Panel via `ImageToolWorkspace` (see `CompressionPanel`, `ResizePanel`)
4. Extend `src/lib/image/` if needed; reuse/extend `imageStore` carefully
5. Pass `HistoryToolId` to `downloadResult(...)` — extend `types/history.ts` if needed
6. Nav link in `Navbar.tsx` + hub card in `app/tools/image/page.tsx`
7. Update `docs/CHECKLIST.md`

## Build (Windows EBUSY fix)

